  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yYXNKdtq/minecraft-title.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252f2dwisp.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Bluesky-Follow-448DEE?style=for-the-badge&logo=bluesky&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Bluesky 追蹤\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f2DWisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Xwitter-Follow-1A1A1A?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Xwitter 追蹤\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCXzb8erNlBkcd6VmE4JWj2A?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&label=YouTube&labelColor=454545&color=E52D27&link=https://www.youtube.com/@2dwisp\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道訂閱者\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252f2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-Support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Ko-fi 贊助\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/simple-grass-flowers?style=for-the-badge&label=Modrinth&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/551206?style=for-the-badge&label=CurseForge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545&color=F1641E\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<h2>🌻 簡介：</h2>\n<p>為草方塊、灰化土與菌絲體方塊添加花朵、石頭、三葉草及其他兼容原版的細節。 </p>\n<p>無需安裝任何模組。</p>\n<p>若您希望草方塊側面更低，請與本資源包搭配安裝我的另一款資源包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Lower Grass Sides</a>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">若您想要相容於 Bare Bones 的版本，請改用安裝此資源包。</a></p>\n<h2>🎨 所有創作：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp 重製原版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwisps-colourful-wildflowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp 的多彩野花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約草花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基礎草花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約低草側</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffancy-full-block-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻滿格草方塊</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-nether-bricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">手工地獄磚</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-rustic-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約鄉村玻璃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fraven-phantoms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">渡鴉幻翼</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-breeze-rod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">優異風息棒</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🤔 常見問題：</h2>\n<p><strong>問：如何安裝此資源包？</strong><br>\n答：請參考 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-install-minecraft-texture-packs-4615399%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此指南</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>問：您會移植到基岩版嗎？</strong><br>\n答：我目前沒有將此移植至基岩版的計畫。</p>\n<p><strong>問：能否讓其他人移植到基岩版？</strong><br>\n答：不行，我不允許第三方移植我的資源包。</p>\n<p><strong>問：您可以新增這個功能嗎？</strong><br>\n答：也許可以！歡迎在留言區提出建議，我們會評估看看。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我發現了錯誤！</strong><br>\n答：請在留言區回報所有問題，我會盡快修復。</p>\n<p><strong>問：此資源包是否適用於 X 版本？</strong><br>\n答：經測試確認，此資源包至少可正常運作至 <strong>1.15</strong> 版本。由於檔案名稱有所變更，較早的版本可能無法使用。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以將其加入我的整合包中嗎？</strong><br>\n答：當然可以！請務必註明出處，且不得宣稱我的作品為您的原創。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/7c463234-3d14-4a86-9788-f3a6d45a2488.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
